// =============================================================================
//  TM XAU SIGNALS  -  v1.0.0
//  Indicator phan tich XAUUSDT theo kien truc docs/indicator-XAU/master-prompt.md
//
//  Layer structure:
//    L0  CONFIG      - input knobs
//    L1  CORE        - ATR, volume, pivot helpers
//    L2  MARKET STR  - Swing, HH/HL/LH/LL, BOS, CHoCH
//    L3  LIQUIDITY   - PDH/PDL, Session Hi/Lo, EqHi/EqLo, Sweep
//    L4  S/R ZONES   - dynamic supply/demand zone detection
//    L5  CANDLE PAT  - reversal + displacement patterns
//    L6A VOLUME     - Volume ratio, spike score
//    L6B INDICATORS  - ATR regime, RSI, Stoch
//    L7  SESSION     - Asia / London / NY detection
//    L8  HTF CONTEXT - Higher timeframe EMA bias
//    L9  SCORING     - weighted 0-100 composite score
//    L10 RISK ENGINE - Entry/SL/TP plan + all gates
//    L11 STATE + VIZ - Position lifecycle + visualization
//    L12 ALERTS      - webhook JSON
//
//  Core principles:
//    - No repaint on confirmed signals (barstate.isconfirmed gate)
//    - No future data leakage (request.security uses [1] + lookahead_on)
//    - No trade without Risk Engine approval
//    - All weights configurable
// =============================================================================
